A fence that leaves a closed nested item opens in the host it lands in

````
> - ::: box
>   - ::: |
>     ```
>     :::
>    ```
>    :::bad
>    :::
- tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <div class="box">
        <ul>
          <li>
            <div class="line-block">
              <p><code></code></p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <pre><code>:::bad
:::
</code></pre>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>tail</li>
</ul>
````

